## 📂 Repository File Architecture

```text
├── design-grants/
│   ├── smart-cooker-2026/             # Form 1, design sheets (Front, Top, Isometric views)
│   ├── smart-scheduler-bag/           # Visual representations and geometric specifications
│   ├── secret-pouch-2024/             # Multi-angle ortho drawings and fabric seams
│   ├── smart-bedpan-2024/             # Industrial design blueprints and contours
│   └── leakproof-mixer-2024/          # Absolute lock-ring dimensional profiles
│
└── compliance-assets/
    └── representations/               # Legal representations and official grant letters
```

---

## 📋 Industrial Classification & Guidelines
*   **Regulatory Alignment:** Filed and evaluated strictly under the Locarno Classification Framework for Industrial Designs.
*   **Design Sheet Standards:** All subfolders contain high-definition visual representations consisting of mandatory perspective views (Front, Rear, Side, Top, Bottom, and Isometric views) defining novel shape, surface pattern, configuration, and ornamentation boundaries.
